window.renderFliggyBrochure=(t)=>`<article class="fliggy-brochure"><img class="fb-hero" src="assets/fliggy-brochure/wide-1-color.png" alt="飞猪展厅宣传折页封面"><section class="fb-copy"><h2>${t('一份折页，两种语言。','One brochure. Two languages.')}</h2><p>${t('以飞猪黄建立品牌识别，中英文版本保持统一的视觉语言与信息层级。','Fliggy yellow anchors the identity, with a consistent visual language and information hierarchy across Chinese and English editions.')}</p></section><img class="fb-wide" src="assets/fliggy-brochure/wide-2-color.png" alt="英文折页外侧全幅展示" loading="lazy"><section class="fb-copy"><h2>${t('展开信息，清晰阅读。','Unfold the story.')}</h2><p>${t('通过模块分区与图文编排，将品牌与业务内容转化为便于浏览的纸上导览。','Modular sections and clear editorial layouts turn brand and business information into an accessible printed guide.')}</p></section><img class="fb-wide" src="assets/fliggy-brochure/wide-3-color.png" alt="中英文折页展开细节" loading="lazy"><section class="fb-copy"><h2>${t('从纸面，走进展厅。','From print to the exhibition.')}</h2><p>${t('让品牌介绍成为可翻阅、可带走的现场沟通载体。','A tangible introduction to the brand, made to browse and take away.')}</p></section><div class="fb-pair fb-real"><img src="assets/fliggy-brochure/exhibition-color.png" alt="中英文折页展厅实拍" loading="lazy"><img src="assets/fliggy-brochure/reading-color.png" alt="现场翻阅折页" loading="lazy"></div></article>`;